            <div xml:id="d234">

                <pb facs="0230" n="218" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg218"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.00/1965: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-12-12T16:00:00+01:00">December 12,
                            1942—4 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 12—2:05 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>7035. Foreign Office, on being informed of substance of Department’s 6255,
                    December 10, 9 p.m., concerning arrest of General Zahidi, stated that, in the
                    view of the British military authorities and of the British Minister in Iran,
                    Zahidi was so deeply and dangerously implicated in the plot organized by German
                    agents that his arrest was considered urgently necessary. Careful consideration
                    was given by these British officials and by the Foreign Office to the
                    advisability of informing the Iranian authorities in advance of their intention
                    to arrest Zahidi but, Foreign Office stated, it was decided that to do so would
                    only embarrass the Iranian authorities. According to its reports, Foreign Office
                    added, the arrest passed off quite unnoticed by the public.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Winant</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
